        {
          "id": 3367095798,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think pipelines (Clang + Code analysis) will start to fail (for the ett) once https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/24892 is merged.  The reason the perl script didn't flag the ett registrations is that it was still looking for the ett init to be set to -1...\n\nI do have another change pending to check_apis.py (to use concurrent.futures), but I don't think it needs to delay Gerald's change.",
